Z||000004||grinthock||08-27-2001||07:03 PM||||Geez we never had networking when I went to school, had to learn it on my own time, that was in between periods and on my lunch... <P>I was (and still am) a geek, most of my highschool career was spent in the director of business ed's office trying to explain why his accounting students couldn't login...<P>"But sir how was I supposed to know the KDPRFR.EXE was the command to KILL the user database!  I mean who named that file anyway?  How was I supposed to know with no manual!   Hey but sir, now I know, it wo'nt happen again"<P>-- True Story<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroworldbanner.gif"> </A> <BR>Fieroworld!  Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
